# Tessera — the breath: Music for 18's pulsing chords. Two drifting saw
# cards with a triangle octave, struck on every eighth and let go into a
# 0.7 hold, so the chord is a shimmer of re-attacks. The breath itself
# is not in the patch: the song rides this track's gain up and down in
# twelve-beat arcs, one lungful per chord.
unison 2
unison_detune 8
spread 0.8
waveform 2
osc2_wave 3
osc2_pitch 12
osc2_level 0.2
osc3_wave 0
osc3_pitch 0
osc3_level 0
detune 7
sub 0
circuit 0
key_track 0.4
attack 0.02
decay 0.25
sustain 0.7
release 0.15
filter_env 0.3
filter_attack 0.005
filter_decay 0.2
filter_sustain 0.5
filter_release 0.15
cutoff 1300
resonance 0.2
drive 1.0
saturation 1.0
hpf 90
volume 0.4
